{
  "title": "Ziyarate Imam Hasan (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا بِقِیَّۃَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَابْنَ اَوَّلِ الْمُسْلِمِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya baqiyyata almu'minina wabna awwali almuslimina\nPeace be upon you, O remnant of the believers and son of the first of the Muslims,\nوَكَیْفَ لاَ تَكُوْنُ كَذَالِكَ\nwa kayfa la takunu kadhalika\nand how could you not be so,\nوَاَنْتَ سَبِیْلُ الْهُدیٰ وَحَلِیْفُ التُّقیٰ\nwa anta sabilu alhuda wa halifu alttuqa\nwhen you are the way of guidance and the ally of piety,\nوَاَصْحَابُ الْكِسآئِ\nwa ashabu alkisa'i\nand (one) of the People of the Cloak.\nغَذَّتْكَ یَدُ الرَّحْمَۃِ\nghadhdhatka yadu alrrahmati\nThe hand of mercy nourished you,\nوَرُبِّیْتَ فِیْ حِجْرِ الْاِسْلاَمِ\nwa rubbita fi hijri al-islami\nyou were raised in the lap of Islam,\nوَرُضِعْتَ مِنْ ثَدْیِ الْاِیْمَانِ\nwa rudi`ta min thadyi al-imani\nand you were suckled from the breast of faith.\nفَطِبْتَ حَیًّا وَطِبْتَ مَیِّتاً\nfatibta hayyan wa tibta mayyitan\nSo you were good in life, and you are good in death,\nغَیْرَ اَنَّ الْاَنْفُسَ غَیْرَ طَیِّبَۃٍ بِفِرَاقِكَ\nghayra anna al-anfusa ghayra tayyibatin bifiraqika\nexcept that our souls are not content with your separation,\nوَلاَ شَاكَّۃٍ فِی الْحَیٰوۃِ لَكَ\nwa la shakkatin fi alhayati laka\nnor doubtful of the (everlasting) life granted to you.\nیَرْحَمُكَ اللّٰهُ۔\nyarhamuka allahu\nMay Allah have mercy on you."
}
